Description:
    Creates the DeployPin initializer and, for ActiveRecord, the migration
    that stores the tasks state in the DB. Outside Rails, run `deploy_pin install`.

Example:
    rails generate deploy_pin:install [--storage=mongoid]

    This will create:
        config/initializers/deploy_pin.rb
        db/migrate/{timestamp}_create_deploy_pins.rb (not with --storage=mongoid)
